# Context-hygiene cleanup ignore policy (Phase A.1)
# See .cursor/plans/context_hygiene_cleanup.md
# Companion to .claude/settings.json deny rules and .gitignore.

# --- Untracked accumulators (worktree pollution, experimental output, dumps) ---
.claude/worktrees/**
experimental_results/**
pg_migration_dumps/**
backup_pg_dumps/**
backup_*/**
data/**
scratch/**
artifacts/**
logs/**

# --- Non-living docs (tombstoned after Phase C; ignored from now on) ---
notebooks/archive/**
docs/history/**
docs/deprecated/**
docs/plans/**
docs/experiments/**
docs/audit/**
docs/design/**
docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/API.md
docs/MIGRATION_GUIDE.md
docs/PHASE1_5_VERIFICATION.md
docs/PLOT_ORGANIZATION.md

# --- Lane-flagged scripts ---
scripts/history/**
scripts/deprecated/**

# --- Bulk data file extensions (anywhere) ---
**/*.pkl
**/*.npz
**/*.parquet
**/*.log

# --- Exceptions (re-allow specific paths) ---
!scratch/claude/README.md
!scratch/local/README.md
!scratch/local/jetstream-remote-build-and-restart.ps1